{"unit_id":"a903067276-rgb__dsh-file-upload#card-zh","repo":"a903067276-rgb/dsh-file-upload","commit":"8c7a17e6399f205620e9c3ebc5080c28d02fa705","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-upload 是面向 DSH 网页端的文件上传插件，在对话输入框旁提供上传按钮，也接管拖入的文件和文件夹。普通文件与文件夹会保存到本地附件库，并将路径引用插入草稿；符合条件的图片可加入 DSH 官方附件栏，其他图片则以路径方式引用。设置页可调整附件目录、路径前缀、图片处理和剪贴板模式。适合需要把本地文件交给 DSH 会话或视觉插件读取的用户。使用前请留意 README 标注的兼容范围：最高支持 DSH 0.1.2。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:735-740","lib/client.js:986-1055","lib/index.js:30-31","README.md:13-18"]}
{"unit_id":"a903067276-rgb__dsh-file-upload#card-en","repo":"a903067276-rgb/dsh-file-upload","commit":"8c7a17e6399f205620e9c3ebc5080c28d02fa705","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-file-upload adds file upload and drag-and-drop to the DSH web composer. Files are saved locally and referenced by path; eligible images may use DSH's attachment rail. Settings control folder, prefix, image and clipboard options. README lists DSH 0.1.2 as the highest supported version.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:735-740","lib/client.js:986-1055","lib/index.js:30-31","README.md:13-18"]}
